# T01 replay script (basic controls). B+n = pad polls after the briefing went up (~1 poll per frame afterwards).
# The pointer is the screen centre: "cursor over X" = the camera look point (left stick) on X.
# Left stick scroll ramps up with the hold time (0.1/frame at first, ~0.9/frame after 60 polls); the
# right stick moves the minimap cursor (3.45 map units per poll, world = 1.5 * map); the camera
# clamps at the map edge (x<=194, y<=141). Timings below were tuned with a live sampler
# (verified: every step completes, all three drones die, ~frame 5100 of the run).
B+60 start                 # close the briefing
B+150 a
# step 1: scroll the camera to the highlighted area (159,128), r=7: sweep right then down through it
B+200 lright:186
B+406 ldown:200
# step 2: minimap cursor to (14,36) r=12 (map units /1.5), then A to jump there; marines appear
B+700 rleft:40             # clamp the minimap cursor at x=0
B+760 rup:40               # ... and y=0
B+820 rdown:7              # y -> 24
B+850 rright:3             # x -> 10
B+900 a
# step 3: camera onto the nearby Marine (17.2,34.7)
B+1000 lright:11
B+1040 lup:13
# step 4: select him; step 5: hold A so the growing circle takes all three Marines
B+1150 a:6
B+1300 a:40
# step 6: scroll to the highlighted area (100,27) and order the move with B (the marines walk ~1000 frames)
B+1500 lright+lup:22
B+1522 lright:90
B+1700 b:5
# step 7: cursor over the first Drone (102,24), B to attack
B+2750 lright+lup:14
B+2764 lup:8
B+2850 lright:11
B+2950 b:5
# step 8: finish the remaining Drones (102,22) and (100,22)
B+3750 lup:13
B+3850 b:5
B+4050 lleft:13
B+4150 b:5
# the last goal is done at ~B+4350 (frame ~5250); A ends the tutorial. Do not leave a briefing for last:
# every briefing is a modal loop (frames stop, polls go on) that only START closes.
B+4400 a:5
# the end screen (MainMenuMarineEnd) waits for a button: START; T02 loads and its briefing (modal) goes up
# ~60 polls later; a second START closes it.
B+4500 start:5
B+4650 start:5
